<title>USA: Dynamic names Glenn Anderson president.</title>
<headline>Dynamic names Glenn Anderson president.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT LAKES, Minn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamic Homes Inc said vice president Glenn Anderson was named president.</p>
<p>He replaces Vern Muzik, who was not reappointed, the company said.</p>
<p>Before joining Dynamic in 1994, Anderson was chief executive of a food company.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
